# The classifier -টা and its allomorphs -টো / -টে, and its genitive -টার:
# H.-R. Thompson, Bengali (LOALL 18, John Benjamins 2012), "ta is added to numbers for time references. tinta baje three
# oclock, sare carta half past four".  The same classifier counts
# things ("duto two"), so a bare N-টা is a clock time only with a
# fraction word before it or বাজে after it.
টা
টো
টে
টার
